    "slot_size": 268,
    "data_size": 264,
    "nom_orig": "Ginko",
    "texte_orig": "But[SP]the[SP]author[SP]of[SP]the[SP]In[SP]Lak'ech[SP]was[SP]the\nghost[SP]we[SP]saw[SP]at[SP]the[SP]clock[SP]tower![1205][001E][SP]Does[SP]that\nmean...[SP]they're[SP]both[SP]Jun's[SP]dad...?",
